<title>CHINA: China 47.9 pct of corn seed up to standard in Q1.</title>
<headline>China 47.9 pct of corn seed up to standard in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Testing of samples of corn seed in six major producing provinces of China showed 47.9 percent were up to standard, the Economic Daily said on Friday.</p>
<p>The figure was 38.9 percentage points higher compared with the year-ago period, it quoted the survey by the State Bureau of Technology Supervision as saying.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
